  "releaseNotes": "Implemented nonrecursive randomized Selection algorithm - QuickSelect - which is linear in expected time, with miniscule chance of going quadratic and is 9X faster than Array.Sort. Implemented Radix Select for unsigned integer array - nearly 50X faster than Array.Sort. Implemented Median-of-Medians Select - which is 2X faster than Array.Sort. Simplified several QuickSort implementations.",
